{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00466","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黑帝羽音 肃和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黑帝羽音 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律回玉琯，星周金度。\n次极阳乌，纪穷阴兔。\n火林霰雪，阳泉凝冱。\n八蜡已登，三农息务。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}